<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS GNOMON RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS GNOMON RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange cleared the 1.44 billion drachma rights issue of construction firm Gnomon, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Gnomon will issue 1.8 million new common registered shares at 800 drachmas each.</p>
<p>The terms will be three new shares per 10 outstanding.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to acquire equipment for its Acheloos dam project, finance the Gouvia marina BOT project and retire debt.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
